    "text": "From acting on block are shown in adjoining figure<br /><br />As the block does not move, hence<br /><br /><math><mi>F</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>°</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0073_013d188db221.png\" style=\"width: 232px; height: 203px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>F</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />On simplification, we get <math><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math> N"
